msgctxt "92"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Hey. How's it going with that inn of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"It's going great! Right now, we've got contractors\r\n"
"remodeling Momiji's family home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"My dad is ecstatic! He's excited to give the inn one\r\n"
"more try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Think you'll make some money out of it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Here's the thing! When I called my customers in Tokyo and\r\n"
"said that I was going to start an inn, reservations started\r\n"
"flooding in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "We're going to be booked for an entire year after we open!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Wow, that's amazing, Kaede."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"At first, I thought people from Tokyo weren't very friendly,\r\n"
"but I'm so thrilled to have met so many warm-hearted\r\n"
"people there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Your kindness and sincerity won their trust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Now you just gotta make sure you don't let 'em down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "I won't!"
msgstr "Non lo farò!"

msgctxt "236"
msgid "You'd better come visit us once we open!"
msgstr ""

